@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 15
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 15
skinparam LegendFontSize 14
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 400
skinparam sequenceMessageSpan true
skinparam sequence {
  MessageSpacing 2
  GroupBorderThickness 1
}
title Sequence view · Submit commits inbox, Job, Attempt and outbox intents · 76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/handlers.py#L70
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/handlers.py#L55
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L232
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L102
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L325
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L136
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L184
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/worker/sqs.py#L343
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/launcher_aws.py#L81
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 17
skinparam maxMessageSize 380
participant "messaging\n«Processing module»" as M $PROC
participant "s: AsyncSession" as DB $INFRA
[-> M : handle_command(f,body) [submit]
activate M
group Processing acceptance transaction
 M -> DB : SQL: accept inbox UUID/hash
 alt duplicate UUID + identical hash
  note over M,DB : Return False; no domain mutation
 else new submit, live guard, no prior Job
  M -> M : _guard(s,owner,asset_id)
  M -> DB : SQL: add/flush Job + Attempt; bind guard
  M -> M : emit_state(s,job,attempt)
  M -> DB : SQL: increment version; stage result + routed work
 end
 M -> DB : COMMIT
end
[<-- M : bool
deactivate M
legend bottom
Selected submit/replay paths; cancelled guard is accepted no-op, matching existing Job is replayed.
Changed identity/content raises and rolls back. No queue send occurs inside this function.
endlegend
@enduml
